    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i'm working on this character, elias, and i'm stuck. he's just... he's reached this point where everything feels gray. no matter what he tries, it doesn't matter. he's just tired of the noise and the constant weight of everything. i'm struggling to write him because i don't see a way out for him that doesn't feel fake or forced. it just feels like he's running out of reasons to keep going, you know?",
